# ===========================================================================
# Land bundled-workbench env knobs. Read by:
#   • Maintain/{Release,Debug}/Build.sh (sets `Pack` and `Boot` from the
#     selected --profile; can be overridden by sourcing this file first)
#   • Element/Sky/astro.config.ts (drives Vite's rollupOptions.input)
#   • Element/Sky/Source/pages/index.astro (renders the bundled Layout
#     for the active workbench when `Boot=true`)
#
# Naming convention: every land-introduced env var is a single-word,
# action-oriented, PascalCase, present-tense verb. No multi-word concat,
# no LAND_ prefix - those are reserved for cross-tool conventions
# (NODE_ENV, RUST_LOG) we cannot rename.
# ===========================================================================

# Space-separated list of workbench variants to pack into a single
# Vite/Astro-bundled tree. Valid values: electron browser sessions
# workbench. Empty (default) emits no bundled tree.
Pack=

# When true, index.astro renders the bundled Layout for the active
# workbench (when its variant is in `Pack`). When false, the existing
# dynamic-import path is used.
Boot=false
